@section Key Management
--keys-list
--keys-add
--keys-admin
--keys-remove
--keys-alias
--keys-gen
--keys-gen-add
@note
  auth_keys_meta supports key_type (individual|bulk), weight, max_sessions, federation_peer_id plus federation_psk_file, permissions.allow_codecs, permissions.allow_services, and permissions.{allow_local_ip,allow_exec,allow_chat,allow_file,allow_bytes}. True control_full or inbound/outbound-admin grants are rejected; admin requires a distinct --admin-keys identity, and outbound admin also requires the visitor identity in --operator-keys.
@end
